    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Datawiza Access Proxy Dashboard\n---\n\nThis workbook visualizes Datawiza Access Proxy (DAP) traffic logs to provide insights into request volume, policy enforcement decisions, authentication activity, and error trends, helping teams monitor access security and proxy health effectively."
      },
      "name": "text - 2"
    },
